{
    "title": "Emoji Maker: DIY Emoji Merge",
    "description": "Emoji Maker: DIY Emoji Merge is an innovative app designed to provide users with a platform\r\nto create and customize your own emojis and combine multiple emojis together to create\r\nunique combination.\r\nTwo main functions: Emoji Maker and Emoji Mixer\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49With Emoji Maker, immerse yourself in a world of endless possibilities. Design emojis from\r\nChoose and customize every detail to suit your mood, personality, and style. From happy smiles come\r\nquirky faces, let your imagination run wild as you bring your emoji creations to life.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49With Emoji Mixer, users can mix and match different emoji components, such as facial expressions,\r\ngestures and accessories to create unique emojis and expressive emojis until you find the perfect emoji\r\nto accurately convey its emotions and messages.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25Main function:\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Endless creativity: Explore endless emoji customization and expression, with new features. Features and updates are \r\nadded regularly to inspire your creativity.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Provides many editing tools so you can customize your emoji perfectly. You can resize and flip the image and even \r\nduplicate special emojis to create uniquely styled emojis.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f With the text feature, you can add special sentences, words on top of your emoji, making them richer and more \r\ninteresting than ever. You can also use the freehand drawing tool to add fun that highlights your emoji's features.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Layer feature, you can stack elements on top of each other, change the order of layers to create Emojis are more \r\ncomplex and personalized.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Custom emoji packs: Create personalized emoji sets with self-designed elements that suit you care about.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Intuitive interface: User-friendly interface makes it easy to design, mix and manage emojis, even for beginners.\r\n\r\nWith Emoji Maker: DIY Emoji Merge app, you can express more emotions and meanings without having to use many words.\r\nThe app's flexibility allows you to customize and adapt to any conversation situation.  From funny jokes to serious \r\nconversations, the app will help you create unique and interesting chatting experiences.\r\n\ud83d\udccc Download now and start exploring a new chat space where creativity and expression are never limited!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Emoji Maker: DIY Emoji Merge is an innovative app designed to provide users with a platform<br>to create and customize your own emojis and combine multiple emojis together to create<br>unique combination.<br>Two main functions: Emoji Maker and Emoji Mixer<br><br>\ud83d\udc49With Emoji Maker, immerse yourself in a world of endless possibilities. Design emojis from<br>Choose and customize every detail to suit your mood, personality, and style. From happy smiles come<br>quirky faces, let your imagination run wild as you bring your emoji creations to life.<br><br>\ud83d\udc49With Emoji Mixer, users can mix and match different emoji components, such as facial expressions,<br>gestures and accessories to create unique emojis and expressive emojis until you find the perfect emoji<br>to accurately convey its emotions and messages.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udd25Main function:<br>\u2714\ufe0f Endless creativity: Explore endless emoji customization and expression, with new features. Features and updates are <br>added regularly to inspire your creativity.<br>\u2714\ufe0f Provides many editing tools so you can customize your emoji perfectly. You can resize and flip the image and even <br>duplicate special emojis to create uniquely styled emojis.<br>\u2714\ufe0f With the text feature, you can add special sentences, words on top of your emoji, making them richer and more <br>interesting than ever. You can also use the freehand drawing tool to add fun that highlights your emoji&#39;s features.<br>\u2714\ufe0f Layer feature, you can stack elements on top of each other, change the order of layers to create Emojis are more <br>complex and personalized.<br>\u2714\ufe0f Custom emoji packs: Create personalized emoji sets with self-designed elements that suit you care about.<br>\u2714\ufe0f Intuitive interface: User-friendly interface makes it easy to design, mix and manage emojis, even for beginners.<br><br>With Emoji Maker: DIY Emoji Merge app, you can express more emotions and meanings without having to use many words.<br>The app&#39;s flexibility allows you to customize and adapt to any conversation situation.  From funny jokes to serious <br>conversations, the app will help you create unique and interesting chatting experiences.<br>\ud83d\udccc Download now and start exploring a new chat space where creativity and expression are never limited!",
